  python3 tools/ladder/musl_patched.py --suite wordexp-memory \
    --evocc target/frontend/debug/evocc --output .build/floating-targeted/NEW
  python3 tools/ladder/musl_patched.py --suite wordexp \
    --evocc target/frontend/debug/evocc --output .build/floating-targeted/OTHER

The second command is expected to remain nonzero until B08d10 closes. The RED
used the retained previous patch/source, not --unpatched-control (that mode
deliberately does not link injected replacement objects). All 304 ladder Python
tests and targeted Ruff pass; a new negative verdict test rejects relabeling
the 12 allocation probes as full wordexp acceptance. No compiler source changed
in this batch, so the prior full Rust health checkpoint is not a new run here.
